Third-party components:

* third_party/pyfrbus/ — the PyFRB/US package and the FRB/US model equations
  (models/model.xml) are works of the U.S. Federal Reserve Board, prepared by a
  U.S. Government employee and therefore in the PUBLIC DOMAIN (see
  third_party/pyfrbus/LICENSE). Minor compatibility patches applied to that code
  are documented in third_party/pyfrbus/PATCHES.md and are likewise dedicated to
  the public domain.

* data/LONGBASE.TXT — the FRB/US public dataset, distributed by the Federal
  Reserve Board (public domain).

The MIT license above applies to the original code in this repository (the
frbus_shock package, the Streamlit app, tests, and workflows).
